{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-b648f7170f9201461b00","title":"辛毗使曹操许袁谭和转攻河北","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-b648f7170f9201461b00","label":"正文","text":"辛毗使曹操许袁谭和转攻河北","evidence":["xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","xinyang-q-1104aecbf6feabe72f61","xinyang-q-5e444782ef4c6ba0d180","xinyang-q-20649b41eba4c1854827"]},{"id":"xinyang-a-d8f69045907b44f0f479","label":"正文","text":"曹操明年克邺表辛毗议郎","evidence":["xinyang-q-3540cf5dfdb31334b68b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"奉使告变；受问；进言；受任","evidence":["xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","xinyang-q-1104aecbf6feabe72f61","xinyang-q-5e444782ef4c6ba0d180","xinyang-q-20649b41eba4c1854827","xinyang-q-3540cf5dfdb31334b68b"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"拟先征荆州；询问；许和攻邺表官","evidence":["xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","xinyang-q-1104aecbf6feabe72f61","xinyang-q-5e444782ef4c6ba0d180","xinyang-q-20649b41eba4c1854827","xinyang-q-3540cf5dfdb31334b68b"]},{"person":"wudi-p0144","role":"闻告；转告","evidence":["xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","xinyang-q-1104aecbf6feabe72f61","xinyang-q-5e444782ef4c6ba0d180","xinyang-q-20649b41eba4c1854827"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","xinyang-q-1104aecbf6feabe72f61","xinyang-q-5e444782ef4c6ba0d180","xinyang-q-20649b41eba4c1854827","xinyang-q-3540cf5dfdb31334b68b"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","order":5016}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0144","name":"郭嘉","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-1104aecbf6feabe72f61","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-c40a2f9c0ef02873626e","layer":"original","quote":"嘉白太祖，太祖谓毗曰：“谭可信？尚必可克不？”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-20649b41eba4c1854827","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-4b19b3fcbb29ff29d35e","layer":"original","quote":"太祖曰：“善。”乃许谭平〖21〗，次于黎阳〖22〗。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-3540cf5dfdb31334b68b","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-4b19b3fcbb29ff29d35e","layer":"original","quote":"明年攻邺，克之，表毗为议郎。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-4a26061c9a35e20bd890","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-d9fe8f3a483e3a56184b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖将征荆州，次于西平。毗见太祖，致谭意，太祖大悦。后数日，更欲先平荆州，使谭、尚自相弊〖4〗。他日置酒，毗望太祖色，知有变，以语郭嘉〖5〗。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-5e444782ef4c6ba0d180","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-0791bdee00c32f3efebd","layer":"original","quote":"毗对曰：“明公无问信与诈也，直当论其势耳：袁氏本兄弟相伐，非谓他人能间其间〖6〗，乃谓天下可定于己也；今一旦求救于明公，此可知也。显甫见显思困而不能取〖7〗，此力竭也。兵革败于外〖8〗，谋臣诛于内；兄弟谗阋〖9〗，国分为二；连年战伐，而介胄生虮虱〖10〗；加以旱蝗，饥馑并臻〖11〗；国无囷仓〖12〗，行无裹粮〖13〗；天灾应于上，人事困于下。民无愚智，皆知土崩瓦解，此乃天亡尚之时也。兵法称：有石城汤池带甲百万而无粟者〖14〗，不能守也。今往攻邺，尚不还救，即不能自守；还救，即谭踵其后。以明公之威，应困穷之敌，击疲敝之寇，无异迅风之振秋叶矣。天以袁尚与明公，明公不取而伐荆州；荆州丰乐，国未有衅。仲虺有言〖15〗：‘取乱侮亡〖16〗。’方今二袁不务远略而内相图，可谓乱矣；居者无食，行者无粮，可谓亡矣。朝不谋夕，民命靡继〖17〗，而不绥之〖18〗，欲待他年；他年或登〖19〗，又自知亡而改修厥德，失所以用兵之要矣。今因其请救而抚之，利莫大焉。且四方之寇，莫大于河北；河北平；则六军盛而天下震〖20〗。”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":453,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
